      "comment": "ZIPPING JAKARA (1) was responsible for a modest effort most recently when seventh at The Gardens over 515m behind Pink Venom (30.63) in a Grade 5. Has claims if she runs up to expectations. MYTHIC (2) has a strong record here with four wins and three placings from 10 starts. Missed the frame latest (32.33) when fifth over 565m at Maitland in a Mix. Makes strong appeal on best. MR. TURBO (7) was out of in the placings when fourth last time but prior to that ran a quick 19.67 win over 340m at this track. Has the ability and looks a key chance. URBAN BOY (3) can measure up with the right run.",
